POST https://localhost:7031/api/telemetry/int
Content-Type: application/json

{
"deviceId": "ESP32-0002",
"metric": "PowerWattage",
"value": 7200,
"unit": "W"
}


### View detected anomalies

GET https://localhost:7031/api/anomalies



